* MVPKG.SH.RM - delete MVPKG.SH's temp files.  Separate because the obvious way
* to clean up is a shell command, and this is the one place that cannot use one
* without recursing into the routine doing the cleaning.
* Copyright (C) 2026 Gordon Heydon.  GPL-2.0-only (see LICENSE).
*
* Only jBASE calls this -- but every platform still COMPILES it, and OSDELETE
* does not exist on UniVerse, so the body is guarded rather than the call.
   SUBROUTINE MVPKG.SH.RM(F1, F2)
$INCLUDE MVPKG.INC PLATFORM.H
$IFDEF JBASE
   OSDELETE F1
   OSDELETE F2
$ENDIF
$IFDEF UDT
   OSDELETE F1
   OSDELETE F2
$ENDIF
   RETURN
